<title>USA: Synergy Media cancels merger, shuts unit.</title>
<headline>Synergy Media cancels merger, shuts unit.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Synergy Media Inc said Tuesday it called off its planned merger with CSG Wireless Inc, a subsidiary of Communications Systems Group Inc.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said it would  close the Minneapolis-based Internet division of its Synergy Communications Inc unit. It said it saw no immediate prospect of the business returning a profit.</p>
</text>
